  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nPulling No Punches is a satirical game in the 2D beat’em up style with classic arcade influences and modern visuals.<p></p>\n<p><b>Release Your Anger!</b><br>\nThe game follows the fictional story of a global pandemic that engulfed the world and is being ignored by fanatics who do not believe that the disease is real. It is up to the main characters, 4 common citizens adequately protected with gloves and masks, to deal with these fanatics and solve the situation with the force of their own fists.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4 Co-op Local Multiplayer!\n</li><li>4 Characters with unique Unlockables and Moves!\n</li><li>Use everything at your disposal to destroy your enemies: a wide variety of punches, kicks, grabs and headbutts!\n</li><li>Handmade art painfully animated frame by frame!\n</li></ul>\n",
